  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On a grey-white stone slab that reveals the Di Qiu map, this Gu has already been used so that after the ink fades Fang Yuan can still recall every detail at extreme clarity. The slab’s maker also used other Gu with it to form that inheritance effect.",
        "chapters": [
          496
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_di_qiu",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Together with emotion poetry Gu, which stores emotions and is extremely rare and very expensive, it is named a wisdom path Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          550
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wisdom-path-pairing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_emotion_poetry_gu",
          "path_wisdom"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The same Di Qiu map stays etched in Fang Yuan’s brain from the stone slab, so he cannot forget it even if he tries.",
        "chapters": [
          552
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wisdom-path-pairing",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When wisdom path’s will line is traced, painting idea Gu is listed among the Gu created after heaven’s will Gu, alongside killing intent Gu, casual Gu, one’s wishes Gu, proud Gu, evil intent Gu and others.",
        "chapters": [
          570
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wisdom-path-pairing",
